Hehe! :-)  It's still on a safe place deep down in Gehennom, guarded
by the High Priest of Moloch. (Only in some earlier Nethack versions
you would have found The Amulet carried by The Wizard.) Now you need
some more work to get it. Want to get spoiled? Then read on...

The (currently) lowest level of Gehennom (with no down staicase) is
the so called Vibrating Square (VS) level. If you reached the level
and found the square where the floor makes strange vibrations you
have to do the invocation rite; the rite requires some items...
+ the Bell of Opening (from the quest)
+ the Candelabrum of Invocation (from Vlad's tower), with
+ 7 candles attached (e.g. from the lighting shop in minetown)
+ the Book of the Dead (from The Wizard)
All (but the candles) must be non-cursed to become a successful rite.

The rite then is to lit the candelabrum, ring the bell, and read the
book. Then a new and quite difficult level will open below your feet;
there you'll find the High Priest of Moloch who will carry The Amulet.

